Description: server: notify systemd once every worker is ready
 Each worker reports to the supervisor (main.ts) once it serves: api and
 maintenance after listening, microservices after startup. Once all started
 workers have reported, the supervisor runs its onAllReady hook, which sends
 READY=1 via systemd-notify when NOTIFY_SOCKET is set. Type=notify units thus
 become active only when immich actually serves, for any
 IMMICH_WORKERS_INCLUDE/EXCLUDE combination.
Author: dionysius <dragon.dionysius@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
